        <bpmn:documentation>Step 1: Sustainability Sourcing Mgr assesses coop readiness to graduate to mainstream vendor (links to VS-03) or scale to larger offtake: capability, consistency, business maturity, certifications (W3130)
Responsible (R): Sustainability Sourcing Mgr
Accountable (A): Sustainability Lead
Duration: Per assessment</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W3133_Flow11</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W3133_Flow11</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W3133_Task6" name="Capacity-Building Partner delivers graduation program: business/financial…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 2: Capacity-Building Partner delivers graduation program: business/financial management, multi-buyer prospecting, contract/legal literacy, digital tools; reduce single-buyer dependency risk
Responsible (R): Capacity-Building Partner
Accountable (A): Sustainability Lead
Duration: Per program</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W3133_Flow12</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W3133_Flow12</bpmn:outgoing>
