      <bpmn:userTask id="W3133_Task7" name="Sustainability Sourcing Mgr transitions graduated coop to mainstream vendor…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 3: Sustainability Sourcing Mgr transitions graduated coop to mainstream vendor master (links to VS-03) or expanded coop role; record graduation outcome in impact tracker (links to W3129)
Responsible (R): Sustainability Sourcing Mgr / IT
Accountable (A): VP Merchandising
Duration: Per graduation</bpmn:documentation>
