      <bpmn:documentation>Trigger: Indigenous-community sourcing opportunity; ancestral-domain product (handicraft, forest materials, traditional knowledge)
Frequency: Event-driven
Volume: Limited; high-sensitivity
Owner: Sustainability Lead
Participants: Sustainability Lead, Legal, NCIP Liaison, Indigenous Community Representatives, Sustainability Sourcing Mgr
Source: workflow W3134 — Indigenous Communities &amp; Ancestral Domain (IPRA) Engagement</bpmn:documentation>
