        <bpmn:text>Controls: - CTL-513 (ensure controlled execution — Impact Measurement, Fair-Trade Compliance &amp; Development Program (PA-94.3).) | - operational: direct-to-beneficiary settlement (W3126) and member-level verification
Owner: Sustainability Lead</bpmn:text>
      </bpmn:textAnnotation>
